            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Solution</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">Developed a unified, HIPAA-compliant booking and intake flow. Engineered a real-time Athenahealth bi-directional sync and a centralized admin panel for multi-location management and patient tracking.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Results</h5>
            <ul class="small mb-0 ps-3" style="line-height: 1.6;">
