            <h5 class="h6 mt-3 mb-1">Challenge</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">Managing after-hours bookings, clinical triage, and billing inquiries without increasing headcount or compromising security standards.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Solution</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">Built a sophisticated Voice AI Agent with a specialized billing voice flow and clinical triage logic. Implemented mission-critical features including "Break Glass" protocols, USCDI export, SMART on FHIR, and HL7v2 messaging. Conducted rigorous load testing and synthetic test harnesses for 99.9% reliability.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Results</h5>
            <ul class="small mb-0 ps-3" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              <li>24/7 automated patient handling</li>
              <li>Full compliance with modern data retention and breach workflows</li>
              <li>Scalable infrastructure capable of handling 5x peak call volume</li>
            </ul>
            <%= link_to "Read case studies →", case_studies_path, class: "d-inline-block mt-3 fw-semibold small" %>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4 p-lg-5 h-100">
